# Runtime

Purpose:
  Agent runtime state and execution context. Tracks current agent,
  session, events, and checkpoints during chain execution.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @agent.sdd (agent capabilities and limits)
   3 @session.sdd (session management)
   4 @current.sdd (current execution state)
   5 @events.sdd (runtime event log)

Rules:
  [RT1] Runtime state MUST be preserved across chain stages.
  [RT2] Checkpoints MUST be created before risky operations.
  [RT3] Events MUST be logged for audit trail.

Navigation:
  Agent: @agent.sdd
  Session: @session.sdd
  Current: @current.sdd
  Events: @events.sdd
  Checkpoints: @checkpoints/

State: +
